      "id": "glz49v5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Lengthiest Written Constitution"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Indian Constitution is recognized as the lengthiest written constitution in the world.",
        "It establishes a federal system with strong unitary features and a parliamentary form of government.",
        "Guarantees Fundamental Rights, Directive Principles of State Policy, and an Independent Judiciary.",
        "Promotes a Secular State with Single Citizenship and Universal Adult Franchise.",
        "Contains specific Emergency Provisions to handle extraordinary situations."
      ],
      "id": "4f7fq17"
    },
